 ghoulish, fiendish of corrupt servants could have come up with that....thing. Intense in its dreadful twisting of human minds, and bringing the World Of Darkness to the brink of becoming the World of Darkestest.<br /> Clearly, if this is not proof - no, a downright shouting from the hills by the Nephandi-bloated Syndicate for the caul-ridden troops from the beyond to invade, I don't know what is.</div> </div> </div> </div>You give the nephandi too much credit.<br /> Truly their biggest achievements are the ones where little effort is required.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-29T11:48:45-07:00","id":1122415,"title":"","content":"And how do the Syndicate fight the entire Technocracy?.<br /> <br /> Do we eat their hype of being the only Convention that knows their shit (being the best at everything) or we will be more realistic and say that they have more economical power than the rest but not as much supernatural might (and their Influence it's probably lower than the NWO)?<br /> <br /> What kind of trump cards will they use, and why the Conventions can't or weren't able to counter them?<br /> <br /> What event would cause the rest of Conventions to ally with the Traditions, and viceversa?<br /> <br /> How will the battle develop? What will the Traditions bring to the table that the Technos can't? What are the actions that the Syndicate needs to accomplish in order to win, and what are the win conditions for the anti-$ alliance?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-29T12:32:59-07:00","id":1122425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aleph</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1122213-technocracy-civil-war-campaign-idea?p=1122415#post1122415\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And how do the Syndicate fight the entire Technocracy?.</div> </div> </div> </div>From the standpoint of considering the Technocracy - without other True Mages being involved - they can't. If the New World Order alone wouldn't be able to win against them - which is a definite possibility - then surely the four Conventions together would destroy and/or dismantle and/or take over the Syndicate in a hostile confrontation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-29T13:42:17-07:00","id":1122466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1122213-technocracy-civil-war-campaign-idea?p=1122425#post1122425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From the standpoint of considering the Technocracy - without other True Mages being involved - they can't. If the New World Order alone wouldn't be able to win against them - which is a definite possibility - then surely the four Conventions together would destroy and/or dismantle and/or take over the Syndicate in a hostile confrontation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except the Syndicate has the wealth of Pentex which means they control the entire Capitalist world. The NWO has been bleeding its influence into them for generations.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-29T15:03:29-07:00","id":1122504,"title":"","content":"That's exagerated, and the influence that they have may as well amount to nothing:<br /> <br /> &quot;The capitalist world&quot; won't protect you against legions of futuristic robots warping to your exact location thanks to the perfect intel of the NWO, then replacing your body with a clon that has your personality and knowledge. And that's just the point of the iceberg.<br /> <br /> NWO can close whole economies, fucking with the methods Syndicate uses to control the world. ItX has great belic capability, and the Syndicate would do better to not underestimate what means to loose the robot convention in this AI controled world. Progenitors basically hold the key for Syndicate high ups bodies because they created the clones all technocracy high ups inhabit (and control Syndicate drug production, among other proffitable industries). The Void Engineers have an unstopable army.<br /> <br /> What I mean it's that it won't be just &quot;mages vs the capitalistic world&quot;-each Convention controls a huge part of what we know as &quot;our modern world&quot; exept for the VE, but they have starships.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 07-29-2017, 06:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-29T15:33:00-07:00","id":1122521,"title":"","content":"ttaThe Syndicate it's going to have to act very decisively. They will have to use the power thy have over capitalism to threaten the Technocracy (one move and the world economy colapses in a way that will make the last financial bubble seem like a party!), and pull off some serious gamechanging shit before the Technocracy can put their act together to eliminate them silently.<br /> <br /> Some ideas:<br /> <br /> The Syndicate was fore long the main suplier of Quintessence of the Union: What the union doesn't know it's that they've subtly sabotaged the supply, with a masterful combination of Primal Utility and Data they tampered with the juice and know exactly where it's all of it and what's being used for (they're good administrators), and they are able to &quot;pull the rug&quot; on every bit of Quintessence the Technocracy has, draining all important Nodes and making almost every artifact cease to function. Then they attack...<br /> <br /> Pentex Syndicate has establihed a connection with Threat Null, and they release it on Earth to distract the Technocracy and the Traditions while the Convention moves to take over all NWO agents and powerbases, effectively taking control of the world. Now mages have a weakened Technocracy and have to face armies of fomori and clever syndicate agents to stop them before the Syndicate summons their deus ex machina to end reality.<br /> <br /> The Syndicate has it's hands on every project of the Union, using this data and their influence they managed to put Technephandy of every convention in charge of almost all major projects and powersources of the Technocracy. This way, when the Technocracy becomes aware Nephandy are controling almost all the major resources and hypertech of every Convention (and they will burn any resource they can't control). The Syndicate joins Pentex and the technephandy reestructures itself to become an evil reflection of the five conventions Technocracy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","user":"Aleph","date":". 07-29-2017, 06:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-29T20:09:19-07:00","id":1122578,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BurritoMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1122213-technocracy-civil-war-campaign-idea?p=1122225#post1122225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bIs this a joke?</div> </div> </div> </div>Lol yup! Guess I didn't make it obvious enough.","sig